{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e95d77ee53d8b8734d4befd515fb5fd5dfa683cea9b10fdec7d4ae2307519421",
      "text": "《7 in LIVE！》结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ba64883dd265438e55a5d48e89e6c6e4beacb5681376448379c9a6482199fe",
      "text": "哇啊！？手机里收到好多信息……\n这全部都是家里人发来的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d02642b9cff597a89c0c661e360f340db353fefcd0cd64c7e79a508e88a57b7",
      "text": "我也是！\n好像全程都在实时给我播报呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b04dabc91857e5c843bf2cf9ff6b800feb65dc04bc03b7f6e187250707d3adb",
      "text": "各位快看！天音用手机\n把我们唱歌的画面录下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:854fb5e38d8e9e205ccab876b441de021c761b15ae8b5c2528b3c449cda51ea4",
      "text": "拍得很不错哦！看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62886fdef997f0c2904ef528aa14e03fbf668814d671ff87f43aaf77d2541496",
      "text": "那么在最后。收看《7 in LIVE！》的各位观众。今天也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3a13ea12f98630daf4d19b5cbe815a0f4b68ad3a24009f25f318b2c6d60aa",
      "text": "路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9fea75d6ccfdd27eadc0b5ba0b8b7ec1d07aebe036aecd55cf6201fa600b79",
      "text": "我出门啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99277047ec754441477cf1734abf019f44cc304b0560f25c965082557d0b1b09",
      "text": "社交平台上同一时间段也有很多\n发表“我出门了！”的内容……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f07e246804c74bdd4dbdbb27eca0ccc740e6accfc8746b50789a676e129ca2bc",
      "text": "看来那是和天音小姐一样，\n回应各位那句“路上小心”的声音呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b38ee96e5179c2d019e671c991e3c219c1521a6c94b1b063216012b4e9d4848",
      "text": "原来是这样吗！？有好多人\n都像天音酱一样给出了回应啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2275f00d41c3df2e291c257d10f8230bef10ee4505c964c1c1a7972d78f466dd",
      "text": "啊啊，只出演今天一天真舍不得啊。\n好想每天都能上节目！对吧，英雄先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12aebf7f1665f55ba5c57967b5bb2c03058d9030ca3c851a52b932e2b6bac120",
      "text": "哈哈，确实是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2429a5d7a8ee08b666f78a50b2060ec1648a84ac318615c8ad8cee6cb2599cbf",
      "text": "不过，取而代之的是，\n我们的歌声会把这份应援传达到大家身边的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000133:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:811a8bffaaa0462e147b48ed01f3a8b44a2a63cb362ae3942bc54830661155af",
      "text": "……啊，辛苦了。\n现在方便通电话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36d8763be129230017709be0b9b5c43c786674c292c22f1aa636e28928992978",
      "text": "粉丝信里写了让人很高兴的事情。\n我想跟你分享一下，所以就联系你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a62e7a4ed407533d4b87a856da02e57d759eada41f0cb782c6f8b867122b155",
      "text": "我不是在新闻节目里回答了那个小朋友的咨询吗？\n那个孩子给我回信了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e799eaf3000f0cc153d3a2cb1702f4e8a7297b88aaa3b85bec06cfd23f94f63",
      "text": "……信上说，那时真的很谢谢你。\n一想到有FRAME在身边，就鼓起了勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc0c6010cd1439a3250fbd7e8b31bb0ecac7de9a9599e291622b9c83aeab1a6",
      "text": "所以，对方说已经没事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:178803add29efc4750ac3c1088d737d2187dab768651b892261a391385b62598",
      "text": "你的心意传达到了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf7d44176963ecd8352bb5bfbbcffbb83214d24148c98bdfc5ffd8f06ce1116d",
      "text": "啊啊。能成为那个孩子的支柱我真高兴。\n成为偶像真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c54fc505a0abffe64aea43a044f24b174f717be9eab62bb559c869a218e8cb4",
      "text": "为了能把勇气传达给更多更多的孩子们，\n我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2449c084a8f295dac7eeaf9bc2ee509d115bd4738a161b2dd120b980e998dcf",
      "text": "我也去跟信玄和龙汇报一下吧。\n谢谢你听我说这些。回见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
